WEBVTT

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:52.900
Seems like the request for approval hasn't been submitted yet.

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:56.190
Blame Domyoji. I reminded him.

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:58.570
Let's go.

00:01:58.570 --> 00:01:59.360
Right.

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:04.580
Looks like it's not a false alarm! The scene is... Mihashira Tower!

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:08.560
The Gold Clan is under attack? What the hell's going on?!

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:11.310
Please wait for me!

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:46.360
It's coming down hard.

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:48.060
Yeah.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:53.110
I can't believe someone is foolish enough to challenge His Excellency.

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:59.580
But that place is Gold Clan territory. Is it okay for us to get involved?

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.890
We have scramble orders. Move out!

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:06.230
Units 20 through 25, close in from the south west side.

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:09.560
Units 26 through 30 will take the northeast side.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:10.960
Surround Mihashira Tower.

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:14.650
We have weather and GPS data via satellite.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:17.240
Ground forces stand by for deployment.

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:21.080
Flight leader to all units. Visibility is poor. Watch the distance between aircrafts.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:23.320
Our cause is pure!

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:33.170
<i>Emergency vehicles are passing. Please pull over to the side.</i>

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:37.150
<i>Emergency vehicles are passing. Please pull over to the side.</i>

00:03:57.190 --> 00:03:59.530
Did we get a hold of security at Mihashira Tower?

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:00.490
Blockade in place!

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:03.280
Hurry up and contact the local police!

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:05.200
This is Scepter 4. Respond, please.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:08.120
The fleet will infiltrate on the order. Check all equipment.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:11.640
Have we confirmed His Excellency's whereabouts? That is top priority!

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:19.220
Special Ops will take the Main Gate. The rest will cordon off the area.

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:20.510
Do not allow the media in!

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:21.790
Roger that.

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:25.660
Wait for the captain's order to move in. 
Do not act on your own.

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:30.170
Captain...

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:37.500
We're ready to move. Please give the order.

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:51.700
Tell them to stand by.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:59.690
<i>So you've crawled out at last.</i>

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:23.610
Yukari! Yukari!

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:25.920
Are you okay? Are you okay?

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:29.950
Oh, yes. Yukari is fit as a fiddle.

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:31.890
Can't say that about those around me though.

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:53.560
Impressive.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:56.410
Just what I'd expect from the famous Usagi.

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:22.310
Douhan, you there?

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:23.630
Detached force reporting.

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:26.860
We've reached the underground databank and have begun work.

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:35.870
But we need a little more time to crack through security.

00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:38.870
Keep the Usagi at bay.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.640
Will do.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:50.490
But to think it's taking this much time to finish what we do best.

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:55.330
I guess the Gold Clan really is gifted.

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:58.140
At least, they're making it more fun for me.

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:04.720
What about your target?

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:06.010
Not a sign of him.

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:11.160
Since the King's not around, there's hardly any tension.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:18.400
I'll get rid of the Usagi.

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:23.730
When you're finished there, Douhan, will you go and escort the princess?

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:24.850
Understood.

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:36.560
Did we get him?!

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:37.810
It's so stuffy in here.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:38.930
What?!

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.840
All right, time to finish this up.

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:46.340
You must find your way.

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:47.760
And overcome obstacles.

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:48.940
Then you will reach it.

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:10.460
And here I am.

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:31.480
Why didn't you let me know sooner that you were both back in town?

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.480
I'll sit here!

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:37.500
Sorry. Meeting up with her took time.

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:40.560
Kukuri! Long time no see!

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:42.990
Long time no see, Neko!

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:49.000
Is the reconstruction of the high school island going well?

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.110
Oh yeah.

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:54.950
It's been about a month since you guys last visited the island...

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:57.700
Well, we've made some progress since then.

00:10:57.700 --> 00:10:59.880
It's just about back to normal.

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:06.260
Oh, but the clock tower and that huge crater hasn't been touched.

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:11.200
How's everything going for you two?

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:18.760
Weren't you looking for someone? What was his name?

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:20.800
Oh yeah, Shiro. Right?

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:23.660
Shiro is nowhere to be found!

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:25.810
Seriously...

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:27.890
How far did he get blown away to?

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:30.460
Wait, he was blown away?!

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:37.430
It's been close to a year now.

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:44.570
Neko and I split up to search, but we couldn't find Shiro.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:49.450
Shiro, where are you?

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:55.120
Are you even alive?

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:01.030
Huh?

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:02.350
Huh?!

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:03.960
Neko, what is it?

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:05.630
Over there!

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:08.290
It's the girl from the Reds!

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:12.110
Sorry, Kukuri.

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:14.650
Can you go on ahead to the island without us?

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:15.820
Huh?

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:17.290
You're not coming?

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:20.110
We'll stop by later. I promise.

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:22.660
Better hurry, or we'll lose her.

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:24.180
Okay, sure.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.180
Guess they're really busy.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:37.620
Anna! This way!

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:43.200
This is the end of the line.

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:46.220
Hand over the girl.

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:49.510
Who the hell are you?!

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:54.120
I have no reason to answer.

00:12:58.570 --> 00:12:59.960
What?

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:06.020
You're with JUNGLE, the Green Clan, I gather.

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:08.550
Well, I know that girl.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:11.810
If you want to continue, I'll take over here.

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:23.210
My business does not involve having to fight you.

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:31.890
Was that the rumored 
manipulation ability of the Green Clan?

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:34.250
Long time no see, Black Dog.

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:37.580
Now I owe you one.

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:41.240
Have we met?

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:42.210
Huh?

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.710
Aw, come on.

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:47.590
Rikio Kamamoto?

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:52.900
Can't say I blame you for not recognizing me right away.

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:57.730
I haven't had much appetite since Mr. Mikoto passed away.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:02.920
Summer's over, yet I'm still skin and bones.

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:04.070
Rikio...

00:14:04.430 --> 00:14:07.640
Hey, but don't you worry, Anna.

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:10.310
I may be thin, but I still pack lots of power.

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:14.810
Why is the Green Clan after you?

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:18.650
We're clueless about what's going on...

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:21.900
But that ninja guy showed up at my place one day,

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:25.070
saying he had a request for Anna.

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:26.090
Request?

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:30.040
He wanted Anna to use her sensory powers...

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:33.100
to "find the Silver King."

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:34.580
What?

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:36.500
You can do that?!

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:39.350
You can find Shiro?!

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:43.610
I can't right now.

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:46.860
Is that so...

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:51.320
Anna's powers have been unstable for a long time.

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:54.850
She can't locate people now.

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:57.690
But you were asked to find him.

00:14:57.690 --> 00:15:00.360
Does that mean he's alive?

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:01.640
I don't know.

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:07.140
Why... is the Green Clan looking for Shiro?

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:09.880
So, what now?

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:13.200
Can't you join up with the rest of your clan?

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:16.890
HOMRA is as good as disbanded right now.

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:22.280
Mr. Mikoto, Mr. Totsuka, and now even Mr. Kusanagi is gone.

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:24.270
It's a no-win situation.

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:26.500
HOMRA's strategist?

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.850
I can't divulge the details...

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:32.720
But Mr. Kusanagi told me to guard Anna.

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:35.530
What about that take-charge clansman?

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:36.390
Huh?

00:15:36.390 --> 00:15:39.900
Isn't he always at the vanguard?

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:42.170
Well... Yata is...

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:03.420
Huh? What's going on?

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:06.590
<i>Hey Yata! Happy birthday!</i>

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:10.430
<i>Yay! Happy birthday!</i>

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:12.510
Misaki, happy birthday.

00:16:12.510 --> 00:16:14.850
<i>Oh yeah...
It's my birthday.</i>

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:18.200
I'm too old for birthday parties.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:21.640
But since you're all here, thanks!

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:23.210
Yeah!

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:27.590
King, it's Yafais birthday.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.210
Say something.

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:30.360
No kidding.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:32.370
<i>Almost time for your 7-5-3 rile of passage?</i>

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:35.410
Aw, gimme a break! I'm eighteen!

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:38.710
<i>Mikoto, don't needle poor Yata—</i>

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:41.960
He had the 7-5-3 rite five years ago, right?

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:43.590
Not even!

00:16:43.590 --> 00:16:47.050
Make way for the birthday cake!

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:49.250
Did you bake this Mr. Totsuka?

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.210
Mr. Mikoto...

00:16:59.640 --> 00:17:00.990
Mr. Totsuka...

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:12.760
Damn everyone for abandoning HOMRA...

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:15.770
Even Mr. Kusanagi...

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:20.160
Yeah, I just got here.

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:22.330
This is some news blackout.

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:24.950
Not a single mention of armed occupation.

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:28.170
Thanks for letting me know, Seri.

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:30.590
I made it in time for the direct flight.

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:34.990
<i>Forget it. But did me pulling strings for you reap benefits?</i>

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:39.100
<i>You were away in Germany for six months doing field investigation.</i>

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:41.480
<i>Coming home empty-handed isn't acceptable.</i>

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:45.190
Don't worry. I did my work.

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:48.880
Can't say whether it'll be useful or not though.

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:54.490
I wish I could've brushed up more on the jargon with the professor there.

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:56.200
But what the heck...

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:57.660
Still...

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:58.640
What?

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:02.040
We're talking about the invincible Gold King...

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:05.880
Starting a fight is out of character for the Green Clan...

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:06.770
At least I think so.

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:11.150
Any unusual movements since the tower was occupied?

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:17.800
They seem to be fiddling with the databank, but otherwise, not a peep out of them.

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:19.530
It's a stalemate.

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:22.980
The Gold King hasn't launched a counterattack...

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:27.750
Judging from the situation, we should assume he's absent.

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:31.230
So they attacked knowing this?

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:32.900
Can't say.

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:36.990
In any case, since we can confirm the influence of the Slates,

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:42.890
my captain's strategy is to lay siege without encroaching on the other king's dominion.

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:46.640
<i>And the captain? How is the Blue King doing?</i>

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:49.920
In top form.

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:52.920
With the Gold King in absentia,

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:56.710
he's stepped in to deal with the situation as well as the agencies involved.

00:18:57.220 --> 00:18:59.030
Fushimi's helping him.

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:01.600
The burden of a King's murder...

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:05.550
Hopefully, it's all unnecessary worry.

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:10.610
<i>Well, this isn't the time to chat.</i>

00:19:10.610 --> 00:19:12.560
<i>I'll see you later.</i>

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:14.560
Yes.

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:41.470
Thanks...

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:44.270
But are you sure about sheltering us?

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:48.330
We have a room at the high school that we use as our home base.

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:53.760
It'll be helpful too, if you can fill in the details for us.

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:56.650
I'm sorry.

00:19:56.650 --> 00:19:57.840
For what?

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:00.660
About your king...

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:04.590
I know he didn't kill Tatara.

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:06.830
And what about you?

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:09.080
You said your powers are unstable...

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:13.240
ls losing the Red King the cause?

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:17.360
No... This is different.

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:26.870
Hey, electricity!

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:28.300
What's going on?

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:31.120
Watch the girl!

00:20:35.530 --> 00:20:38.380
I'm feeling all tingly! Something is coming!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:49.040
As one travels on,

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:50.540
a reunion awaits them.

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:51.810
For the right moment.

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:55.800
That haiku... is by Master Ichigen...

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:56.810
No way!

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:08.060
I wonder why his poems are so touching...

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:11.480
Hi Kuroh... It's been a while, hasn't it?

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:13.330
Have you been well?

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:16.020
Yukari Mishakuji...

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:18.840
Hey, who is that?

00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:21.150
Yukari Mishakuji.

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:26.080
Former clansmen of the late 
Seventh King, Master lchigen Miwa...

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:27.840
And student in swordsmanship...

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:32.120
I once addressed him as... my senior.

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:33.980
S-Senior?

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:40.420
What the hell are you doing here?

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:43.510
Oh, wipe that scary look off your face.

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:46.860
Aren't you happy to see me?

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:51.100
You? Someone who pointed his blade at Master lchigen?!

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:52.370
Stop messing around!

00:21:55.270 --> 00:21:58.580
Oh, that was just a test of our spirit.

00:21:59.110 --> 00:22:03.130
That's the strong bond that he and I shared.

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:05.780
You still don't understand that?

00:22:05.780 --> 00:22:07.380
Lies!

00:22:08.120 --> 00:22:13.890
When I learned of his death, I cried for the first time in a long while.

00:22:14.620 --> 00:22:17.130
I still carry those feelings with me.

00:22:17.130 --> 00:22:20.650
But now you show up to get in my way...

00:22:24.050 --> 00:22:27.780
Answer me, are you with the Green Clan?

00:22:27.780 --> 00:22:30.160
Yes. That's why...

00:22:31.140 --> 00:22:33.530
I'm taking that girl.

00:22:34.140 --> 00:22:36.560
S-So then Shiro...

00:22:36.560 --> 00:22:39.790
Adolf K. Weismann is alive?!

00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:44.650
I dunno. That's what we want to find out...

00:22:44.650 --> 00:22:48.550
If our biggest threat to the Green Clan...

00:22:48.950 --> 00:22:51.270
is dead or alive.

00:22:56.170 --> 00:22:56.930
Kurosuke!

00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:05.110
I was quite pleased when I learned that we've become foes.

00:23:06.340 --> 00:23:10.430
See, I was determined to overcome our tragic destiny.

00:23:10.430 --> 00:23:12.930
But you, Kuroh...

00:23:12.930 --> 00:23:13.740
Get away from here!

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:16.300
R-Right! Anna!

00:23:19.860 --> 00:23:21.870
What's with...this sword?

00:23:29.160 --> 00:23:32.660
And here I was looking forward to sparring with you...

00:23:32.660 --> 00:23:34.260
This isn't even fun.

00:23:34.620 --> 00:23:37.310
There's nothing to learn from you at this point!

00:23:44.130 --> 00:23:45.650
Rikio!

00:23:49.390 --> 00:23:52.660
I'm taking Anna Kushina.

00:23:54.970 --> 00:23:56.910
S-Stop!

00:23:56.910 --> 00:23:58.040
C'mon, shape up.

00:23:58.480 --> 00:24:00.620
How can you call yourself his pupil?

00:24:01.980 --> 00:24:03.330
Damn you!

00:24:09.510 --> 00:24:12.970
You can't beat me by just going through the motions.

00:24:15.080 --> 00:24:18.890
Right now, you are no match for me.

00:24:20.330 --> 00:24:22.750
Not in sword skills or frame of mind...

00:24:22.750 --> 00:24:26.370
But least of all, beauty.

00:24:29.380 --> 00:24:31.780
Oh? Mission accomplished already?

00:24:32.390 --> 00:24:34.280
And that means this lesson is over.

00:24:34.280 --> 00:24:35.770
Too bad.

00:24:35.770 --> 00:24:36.850
Anna!

00:24:36.850 --> 00:24:37.780
You're not getting away!

00:24:42.770 --> 00:24:44.960
We'll meet again, Kuroh.

00:24:44.960 --> 00:24:49.840
Next time though, be more mentally prepared.

00:24:56.740 --> 00:24:58.230
Are you okay?

00:24:59.710 --> 00:25:01.370
N-Never mind me...

00:25:01.370 --> 00:25:02.910
Save Anna...

00:25:03.460 --> 00:25:05.480
Go after them!

00:25:05.880 --> 00:25:08.300
All right. Leave it to me!

00:25:08.300 --> 00:25:09.920
Neko, can you track them?

00:25:09.920 --> 00:25:13.490
Pretty much... This way!

00:25:19.200 --> 00:25:22.950
Y-Yata... Big trouble!

00:25:23.560 --> 00:25:25.650
Not so loud.

00:25:25.650 --> 00:25:29.960
You know how Mr. Kusanagi always
 nags about keeping it quiet in the bar.

00:25:30.240 --> 00:25:32.660
And where is this Mr. Kusanagi you ask?

00:25:32.660 --> 00:25:36.440
He deserted his precious bar and went off somewhere.

00:25:39.000 --> 00:25:39.840
Huh?

00:25:40.120 --> 00:25:42.100
H-Hey, what happened?!

00:25:42.100 --> 00:25:46.340
Snap out of it, will you, Yata?!

00:25:46.340 --> 00:25:47.590
There's trouble!

00:25:47.590 --> 00:25:48.850
It's Anna...

00:25:51.300 --> 00:25:52.760
So?

00:25:52.760 --> 00:25:56.930
Where'd this pansy take Anna?

00:25:56.930 --> 00:25:59.770
The Black Dog went after them...

00:25:59.770 --> 00:26:01.630
But I haven't heard back yet.

00:26:10.360 --> 00:26:11.970
Yata...

00:26:12.700 --> 00:26:14.860
What about Fushimi?

00:26:14.860 --> 00:26:17.880
Maybe Fushimi would know something...

00:26:18.370 --> 00:26:20.820
He has access to the Blue's information network...

00:26:35.720 --> 00:26:37.400
Is this Saruhiko?

00:26:38.220 --> 00:26:40.060
At least identify yourself.

00:26:40.060 --> 00:26:42.490
<i>You're not on my caller ID list.</i>

00:26:42.730 --> 00:26:44.490
Do I know you?

00:26:44.890 --> 00:26:46.560
You damn monkey...

00:26:46.560 --> 00:26:48.480
Are you trying to start a fight with me?!

00:26:48.480 --> 00:26:50.150
Fight?

00:26:50.150 --> 00:26:53.630
<i>Fighting you right now wouldn't be any fun.</i>

00:26:54.400 --> 00:27:00.260
Taking on someone who's not under a Sanctum's protection would be bullying.

00:27:02.700 --> 00:27:06.430
Mr. Mikoto's power is still inside me!

00:27:06.750 --> 00:27:08.860
<i>I'll fight you anytime!</i>

00:27:10.250 --> 00:27:12.030
No thanks.

00:27:12.590 --> 00:27:15.720
But if you insist on fighting me,

00:27:15.720 --> 00:27:18.830
then I suggest you change clans.

00:27:19.430 --> 00:27:21.200
<i>I'm not like you!</i>

00:27:21.890 --> 00:27:23.880
HOMRA is the only clan for me!

00:27:24.680 --> 00:27:27.880
Yeah, and it's as good as dead!

00:27:30.400 --> 00:27:33.960
That's what you get when you rely on things like friends.

00:27:36.780 --> 00:27:38.610
Listen to me, Saruhiko.

00:27:38.610 --> 00:27:40.530
Anna's been kidnapped.

00:27:40.530 --> 00:27:41.910
According to Kamamoto,

00:27:41.910 --> 00:27:45.250
a guy from the Green Clan named Mishakuji is behind it!

00:27:45.250 --> 00:27:48.790
But we don't know where they took her.

00:27:48.790 --> 00:27:51.750
Do you guys have any information?

00:27:51.750 --> 00:27:53.200
<i>If you know anything...</i>

00:27:54.880 --> 00:27:57.750
Please! Tell me.

00:27:59.050 --> 00:28:01.990
I'm not your informant.

00:28:01.990 --> 00:28:07.020
You think I like having to ask you?! It makes me wanna throw up!

00:28:07.020 --> 00:28:11.310
But Mr. Mikoto, Mr. Totsuka...

00:28:11.310 --> 00:28:13.370
Even Mr. Kusanagi... They're all gone.

00:28:13.730 --> 00:28:16.650
I can't think of anyone else to turn to...

00:28:16.650 --> 00:28:18.130
You're the only one that's left!

00:28:18.820 --> 00:28:22.270
You don't have anything against Anna, do you?!

00:28:37.900 --> 00:28:39.510
Shit!

00:28:39.510 --> 00:28:43.920
I was stupid to even think he'd have a heart!

00:28:48.020 --> 00:28:50.300
W-What'll we do, Yata?

00:29:00.280 --> 00:29:01.210
Huh?

00:29:05.490 --> 00:29:07.150
Saruhiko...

00:29:12.540 --> 00:29:17.830
I've identified the one from JUNGLE who attacked Mihashira Tower.

00:29:18.520 --> 00:29:20.720
Yukari Mishakuji.

00:29:20.720 --> 00:29:25.670
A former vassal of the previous Colorless King, lchigen Miwa.

00:29:27.220 --> 00:29:29.340
Colorless and Green...

00:29:29.810 --> 00:29:33.650
Someone like you... who uses two colors?

00:29:33.650 --> 00:29:37.040
I'm impressed that you learned so much in such a short time.

00:29:37.400 --> 00:29:40.900
I was asked to assist on another matter.

00:29:40.900 --> 00:29:45.170
I was doing research on it and by chance, there was a connection.

00:29:46.240 --> 00:29:51.360
JUNGLE is a unique clan that has wide presence on the Internet.

00:29:51.830 --> 00:29:54.710
Through downloadable apps,

00:29:54.710 --> 00:29:58.030
they have access to unspecified numbers of clansmen.

00:29:58.550 --> 00:29:59.990
Please take a look at this.

00:30:03.840 --> 00:30:05.490
Hmm? This is...?

00:30:06.180 --> 00:30:12.620
Higher-ranking clansmen possess the Green Clan's manipulation ability.

00:30:13.600 --> 00:30:18.890
They can alter the laws of physics, and have far greater strength than the average man...

00:30:19.400 --> 00:30:21.630
In particular, this masked clansman...

00:30:21.940 --> 00:30:25.190
He's a ninja. Very interesting.

00:30:25.870 --> 00:30:30.220
This masked clansman uses the manipulation ability...

00:30:30.700 --> 00:30:35.120
and as you can see, he can pass through walls.

00:30:35.120 --> 00:30:40.350
As a result, the security at Mihashira Tower is meaningless.

00:30:41.550 --> 00:30:44.480
This is just like a ninja passing through walls.

00:30:48.470 --> 00:30:49.360
This masked—

00:30:49.360 --> 00:30:50.870
This ninja!

00:30:51.640 --> 00:30:53.770
This masked man is probably,

00:30:53.770 --> 00:30:57.980
like Mishakuji, a highly skilled man.

00:30:57.980 --> 00:30:59.980
No, this is ninjutsu—

00:30:59.980 --> 00:31:01.380
In any case...

00:31:01.390 --> 00:31:03.380
This is the real problem.

00:31:03.990 --> 00:31:05.770
It's the Red clansman...

00:31:06.320 --> 00:31:09.630
Or should I say, ex-Red clansman, Anna Kushina.

00:31:10.120 --> 00:31:13.230
The reason behind her kidnapping is not clear, but...

00:31:13.660 --> 00:31:16.020
It can't be for any good purpose.

00:31:16.250 --> 00:31:17.740
Anna Kushina...

00:31:18.630 --> 00:31:21.520
Suoh's memento...

00:31:21.840 --> 00:31:23.380
Something like that...

00:31:23.380 --> 00:31:24.110
I see...

00:31:24.510 --> 00:31:28.180
I now have an idea of the enemy's intention.

00:31:28.180 --> 00:31:32.620
It seems we'll have no choice but to act.

00:31:33.270 --> 00:31:35.850
What about coordination with the other agencies?

00:31:35.850 --> 00:31:36.740
Completed, sir.

00:31:37.020 --> 00:31:38.350
Good.

00:31:38.350 --> 00:31:41.870
Well then, it's time we get going.

00:31:42.530 --> 00:31:46.750
By the way, who was it that asked for your assistance?

00:31:48.700 --> 00:31:50.880
Am I obliged to tell you sir?

00:31:51.120 --> 00:31:55.010
Not at all... I trust your work.

00:31:58.710 --> 00:32:00.810
Meooow!

00:32:10.140 --> 00:32:13.160
I never expected it to be like this.

00:32:13.160 --> 00:32:14.220
Kurosuke!

00:32:14.220 --> 00:32:17.530
That flashy man from earlier is in there! Aren't we going?

00:32:17.850 --> 00:32:19.350
Wait.

00:32:19.350 --> 00:32:23.980
Let's gather more information and plan our infiltration carefully.

00:32:23.980 --> 00:32:25.540
Huh? Why?!

00:32:25.990 --> 00:32:28.530
First, there's the Blue Clan to worry about.

00:32:28.530 --> 00:32:33.050
And inside the building, the Green Clan is probably lying in wait.

00:32:33.050 --> 00:32:38.360
Only a fool would attempt to break through from the front.

00:32:43.310 --> 00:32:45.020
Outta the way, you Blue!

00:32:45.050 --> 00:32:46.290
It's HOMRA's Yatagarasu!

00:32:46.290 --> 00:32:46.730
Yatagarasu?!

00:32:47.090 --> 00:32:48.540
Move!

00:32:50.430 --> 00:32:52.210
A fool just went in.

00:32:52.930 --> 00:32:54.570
We have no choice! Let's go!

00:32:54.570 --> 00:32:57.830
Huh? Now you're talking!

00:33:03.940 --> 00:33:04.790
Touchdown!

00:33:05.440 --> 00:33:06.460
Let them go!

00:33:07.280 --> 00:33:09.060
Maintain the blockade!

00:33:10.780 --> 00:33:12.420
Anna!

00:33:13.280 --> 00:33:16.680
Damn lackeys! As if you can hit me!

00:33:20.470 --> 00:33:21.690
An intruder?!

00:33:21.690 --> 00:33:22.790
It's a HOMRA remnant!

00:33:22.790 --> 00:33:23.560
Move!

00:33:28.150 --> 00:33:29.700
Get lost!

00:33:30.630 --> 00:33:32.280
I ain't interested in small fry!

00:33:32.280 --> 00:33:33.310
It's Yata of HOMRA!

00:33:33.310 --> 00:33:34.090
Damn freak!

00:33:34.090 --> 00:33:36.030
Stop! You'll hit our guys!

00:33:36.030 --> 00:33:38.470
Heh! You cowards!

00:33:38.470 --> 00:33:39.070
Huh?

00:33:39.980 --> 00:33:42.370
A-A-A girl?!

00:33:46.150 --> 00:33:48.100
Ow!

00:33:49.000 --> 00:33:50.170
You?!

00:33:55.740 --> 00:33:58.430
Use your head a little.

00:33:58.430 --> 00:33:59.750
Misaki Yata.

00:33:59.750 --> 00:34:02.920
Huh? Who called you...

00:34:02.920 --> 00:34:04.330
Shit dog?!

00:34:04.330 --> 00:34:05.780
Shit dog...?

00:34:06.590 --> 00:34:09.280
Shut your... uncouth mouth!

00:34:10.670 --> 00:34:15.280
Sorry, I had a rotten upbringing!

00:34:20.020 --> 00:34:21.020
Meow!

00:34:21.020 --> 00:34:23.490
Listen to my plans!

00:34:23.940 --> 00:34:26.360
First, stop fighting, you two!

00:34:26.360 --> 00:34:28.020
Then...

00:34:28.020 --> 00:34:30.690
Then we all help each other and save Anna!

00:34:30.690 --> 00:34:31.420
Okay?

00:34:31.610 --> 00:34:33.550
Let's go!

00:34:34.300 --> 00:34:37.340
Hey! Who made you boss?

00:34:37.340 --> 00:34:39.590
Damn, more of them!

00:34:39.790 --> 00:34:40.940
Neko!

00:34:41.370 --> 00:34:42.850
Leave it to me!

00:34:43.120 --> 00:34:46.040
Special Attack!

00:34:46.040 --> 00:34:48.770
Cat the Mountain!

00:34:49.630 --> 00:34:51.830
Meow!

00:34:55.480 --> 00:34:59.330
Hey, is that chick gonna be okay on her own?

00:35:03.520 --> 00:35:05.990
Don't underestimate a Silver clansman.

00:35:07.230 --> 00:35:11.130
You...that chick...every damn one of you...!

00:35:11.130 --> 00:35:13.090
You all piss me off!

00:35:21.260 --> 00:35:23.050
Come on. Don't be like that.

00:35:23.050 --> 00:35:24.580
On a mountain pass.

00:35:24.580 --> 00:35:26.040
Accompanied by a friend.

00:35:26.040 --> 00:35:27.560
One should have no fear.

00:35:27.750 --> 00:35:29.030
What do you think?!

00:35:31.420 --> 00:35:33.060
Huh? That's creepy.

00:35:33.590 --> 00:35:35.940
What?! How dare you!

00:35:37.220 --> 00:35:38.540
Anna!

00:35:46.190 --> 00:35:47.830
Anna!

00:35:51.070 --> 00:35:54.080
You bastards! What're you doing to Anna?!

00:35:54.570 --> 00:35:57.730
Oh, what an energetic boy.

00:35:58.200 --> 00:36:00.090
We're not doing a thing.

00:36:00.570 --> 00:36:05.620
Just asking the cute little bird for a small favor.

00:36:05.620 --> 00:36:06.850
Cute little bird!

00:36:06.850 --> 00:36:08.720
What?!

00:36:15.130 --> 00:36:17.130
I'll leave the hotheaded one to you.

00:36:17.130 --> 00:36:18.250
Understood.

00:36:19.050 --> 00:36:20.360
What?!

00:36:27.140 --> 00:36:29.810
Kotosaka, you watch below, okay?

00:36:29.810 --> 00:36:32.820
Caw! Understood! Understood!

00:36:32.820 --> 00:36:38.490
And I... will put my dear Kuroh through a beautiful initiation.

00:36:38.490 --> 00:36:39.890
Enough of your rambling...

00:36:40.490 --> 00:36:41.880
Yukari Mishakuji!

00:36:44.120 --> 00:36:47.330
First, I'll teach you manners, Kuroh!

00:36:47.330 --> 00:36:49.850
Call me Big Brother!

00:36:51.790 --> 00:36:53.640
Kaboom!

00:36:53.640 --> 00:36:55.350
Cat goes boom!

00:36:55.750 --> 00:36:57.420
Meow-haha!

00:36:57.420 --> 00:37:00.340
Found her! Stupid cat! Stupid cat!

00:37:00.340 --> 00:37:02.260
Stupid cat! Stupid cat!

00:37:02.260 --> 00:37:04.760
Meow?! Who're you calling "stupid"?!

00:37:04.760 --> 00:37:06.960
Caww! Thunder!

00:37:09.310 --> 00:37:11.150
Caw caw!

00:37:11.150 --> 00:37:12.040
Neko Touch!

00:37:19.670 --> 00:37:22.200
Kotosaka Thunder!

00:37:22.200 --> 00:37:23.380
Meowww!

00:37:23.950 --> 00:37:27.320
Meow, meow?!

00:37:31.870 --> 00:37:33.020
Meow?!

00:37:34.730 --> 00:37:36.920
Caw?! Another enemy! Another enemy!

00:37:36.920 --> 00:37:38.490
Cawww!

00:37:47.890 --> 00:37:50.480
Still no progress, Kuroh.

00:37:50.480 --> 00:37:55.410
All you ever do is cling on to things.

00:37:55.900 --> 00:38:01.920
You'll never be able to go anywhere unless you learn how to let go.

00:38:01.920 --> 00:38:03.380
Shut up!

00:38:08.910 --> 00:38:10.980
That's right. I'm over here.

00:38:12.410 --> 00:38:15.200
I'll shut you up, once and for all!

00:38:16.380 --> 00:38:17.940
That's the spirit.

00:38:20.760 --> 00:38:22.540
I'm at a disadvantage here.

00:38:32.940 --> 00:38:37.720
Aha! Yes, Kuroh, keep it up.

00:38:38.770 --> 00:38:41.920
Oh my, after I just complimented you...

00:38:42.740 --> 00:38:45.420
There you go, dropping to your knee.

00:38:46.450 --> 00:38:48.930
Come on, on guard.

00:38:50.620 --> 00:38:51.600
Come!

00:38:53.290 --> 00:38:56.560
He's such a handful...

00:38:57.630 --> 00:38:59.520
What? You want to play tag now?

00:39:01.560 --> 00:39:04.020
How's this?!

00:39:04.090 --> 00:39:07.240
Good. Yes, yes.

00:39:08.550 --> 00:39:10.160
More, Kuroh!

00:39:11.160 --> 00:39:12.700
Still not good enough!

00:39:12.700 --> 00:39:14.870
This is how you slash!

00:39:15.640 --> 00:39:17.750
Still think you're giving me lessons?!

00:39:23.900 --> 00:39:26.270
This brings back memories.

00:39:37.270 --> 00:39:39.480
<i>Damn it. What a creepy guy!</i>

00:39:52.680 --> 00:39:53.960
Misaki!

00:39:54.850 --> 00:39:58.250
Don't worry. I'm just upping the odds in his favor.

00:39:58.600 --> 00:40:02.540
Then I'll take those odds and send you to hell.

00:40:04.480 --> 00:40:05.610
Who's there?!

00:40:05.610 --> 00:40:07.920
Caw! Another enemy! Another enemy!

00:40:07.920 --> 00:40:09.640
The enemy from HOMRA!

00:40:15.040 --> 00:40:17.160
Mr. Kusanagi!

00:40:17.160 --> 00:40:19.650
Hey, it's been a while.

00:40:30.720 --> 00:40:31.320
Bang!

00:40:36.850 --> 00:40:38.510
How did you know we were here...?

00:40:39.520 --> 00:40:42.230
What made you decide to show up after all this time?

00:40:42.230 --> 00:40:44.150
Same reason as you.

00:40:44.150 --> 00:40:46.540
To save our princess.

00:40:46.990 --> 00:40:48.820
Show off!

00:40:48.820 --> 00:40:50.880
Glasses! Hey, Sunglasses!

00:40:51.240 --> 00:40:54.550
It won't open!

00:40:54.550 --> 00:40:56.600
I will not let you take that girl!

00:41:00.020 --> 00:41:03.480
That's my line!

00:41:13.600 --> 00:41:16.430
With HOMRA's Number 2 here, you're...

00:41:16.430 --> 00:41:19.520
Yata, buy me some time, will ya?

00:41:19.520 --> 00:41:22.000
Huh? Hey, Mr. Kusanagi...!

00:41:22.850 --> 00:41:24.870
This is important.

00:41:25.360 --> 00:41:27.380
I'm counting on you, Yatagarasu.

00:41:30.110 --> 00:41:34.510
Well, I can't let you down if you're calling me by that name!

00:41:37.290 --> 00:41:39.750
Bring it on, cosplay ninja!

00:41:39.750 --> 00:41:44.520
HOMRA's Yatagarasu is gonna destroy you!

00:41:50.260 --> 00:41:51.580
Sorry.

00:41:52.130 --> 00:41:57.160
I went all the way to Germany to investigate, hoping I could do something about this...

00:41:58.140 --> 00:42:00.280
But I was too late.

00:42:02.980 --> 00:42:05.120
Izumo...

00:42:07.440 --> 00:42:12.430
It's no use avoiding it any longer.

00:42:13.160 --> 00:42:14.270
Anna.

00:42:15.070 --> 00:42:16.270
No...

00:42:58.160 --> 00:42:59.880
Tatara?

00:43:08.500 --> 00:43:10.830
Morning, Anna.

00:43:12.210 --> 00:43:14.380
Are you okay?

00:43:14.380 --> 00:43:15.570
You look like you're in pain.

00:43:16.840 --> 00:43:18.290
I'm okay.

00:43:21.890 --> 00:43:24.450
I feel like I've been having a bad dream.

00:43:25.730 --> 00:43:28.510
A bad dream?

00:43:31.730 --> 00:43:35.400
Tatara, you were killed and...

00:43:35.400 --> 00:43:38.350
Mikoto went to avenge you and...

00:43:39.990 --> 00:43:41.840
Then he died too...

00:43:42.830 --> 00:43:47.530
And everyone got separated and...

00:43:54.340 --> 00:43:55.870
No, that's not right...

00:43:59.260 --> 00:44:03.210
This is the dream, isn't it?

00:44:03.680 --> 00:44:04.620
Yes...

00:44:06.770 --> 00:44:08.240
I'm sorry.

00:44:19.610 --> 00:44:20.850
Anna...

00:44:21.780 --> 00:44:24.010
Go talk to him.

00:44:36.760 --> 00:44:37.980
Stupid Mikoto!

00:44:39.220 --> 00:44:40.420
Yeah.

00:44:41.470 --> 00:44:42.490
How could you!

00:44:44.260 --> 00:44:45.250
Yeah...

00:44:49.310 --> 00:44:51.590
But Mikoto...

00:44:55.320 --> 00:45:00.440
Your red is still warm.

00:45:07.250 --> 00:45:11.180
That's not my red.

00:45:13.170 --> 00:45:14.950
That's your red.

00:45:18.260 --> 00:45:20.080
Your color.

00:45:24.010 --> 00:45:26.130
Your red...

00:45:26.600 --> 00:45:29.330
My red.

00:45:29.600 --> 00:45:32.630
Can I turn this red...

00:45:33.270 --> 00:45:36.140
into a power that protects?

00:45:40.150 --> 00:45:46.150
Anna, you wouldn't let a bad dream end as a bad dream.

00:46:09.560 --> 00:46:10.840
Anna...

00:46:23.740 --> 00:46:27.870
It's no use avoiding it any longer.

00:46:27.870 --> 00:46:28.860
Anna.

00:46:29.410 --> 00:46:30.480
No...

00:46:31.080 --> 00:46:32.650
Red King.

00:46:34.750 --> 00:46:37.090
No Blood...

00:46:37.090 --> 00:46:39.020
No Bone...

00:46:40.590 --> 00:46:43.190
No Ash!

00:47:36.560 --> 00:47:39.960
The Sword of... Damocles?

00:47:40.610 --> 00:47:41.930
It can't be...

00:47:59.130 --> 00:48:00.180
Our symbol...

00:48:11.180 --> 00:48:12.200
That's...

00:48:15.520 --> 00:48:16.960
Was that...?

00:48:35.620 --> 00:48:37.320
Awesome...

00:48:50.340 --> 00:48:51.260
Power...

00:48:51.260 --> 00:48:53.330
I'm overflowing with power!

00:48:56.720 --> 00:48:57.780
Here I come!

00:49:14.660 --> 00:49:15.860
Anna!

00:49:43.860 --> 00:49:45.550
What's happening?

00:49:47.610 --> 00:49:50.420
Looks like things are really starting to heat up!

00:50:01.210 --> 00:50:05.180
I will not lose to you!

00:50:24.150 --> 00:50:28.000
Still running away... Kuroh?!

00:50:30.150 --> 00:50:35.270
Kuroh, I'll tell you why you'll never be able to beat me.

00:50:35.780 --> 00:50:37.510
Are you still harping about that?!

00:50:37.510 --> 00:50:41.260
This sword holds my entire being.

00:50:45.430 --> 00:50:46.140
Joy,

00:50:47.420 --> 00:50:51.900
anger, sadness, happiness, fear, hesitation, shock...

00:50:52.090 --> 00:50:54.070
madness, anxiety, pride...

00:50:54.630 --> 00:50:55.350
Honor!

00:51:03.350 --> 00:51:05.370
And... love!

00:51:05.850 --> 00:51:07.300
It's collapsing!

00:51:08.190 --> 00:51:09.110
Watch out!

00:51:09.110 --> 00:51:11.360
Deploy the shield and withdraw! Fushimi!

00:51:11.360 --> 00:51:12.320
Roger that!

00:51:12.320 --> 00:51:14.980
Go back twenty meters and put up the barricade again!

00:51:19.660 --> 00:51:22.700
But your sword is empty...

00:51:22.700 --> 00:51:27.890
You swing lchigen Miwa's precious blade, Kotowari, like a mere stick.

00:51:28.330 --> 00:51:29.880
Is it any wonder then,

00:51:29.880 --> 00:51:36.400
that it's useless against my sword, which overflows with my soul?

00:51:36.400 --> 00:51:37.900
Don't give in, Kurosuke!

00:51:39.900 --> 00:51:42.910
We're going to see Shiro again, remember?!

00:51:46.390 --> 00:51:47.630
Shiro...

00:51:48.230 --> 00:51:51.140
My sword is empty...

00:51:53.900 --> 00:51:55.670
What's the purpose for my sword?

00:51:57.910 --> 00:51:59.740
Kuroh Yatogami,

00:51:59.740 --> 00:52:04.250
<i>do solemnly swear to henceforth devote my life to serving...</i>

00:52:04.250 --> 00:52:08.530
<i>the First King, Adolf K. Weismann, as his clansman.</i>

00:52:10.080 --> 00:52:12.530
I wish you would loosen up.

00:52:13.340 --> 00:52:16.660
There's no need for such ceremony for us to be friends.

00:52:17.220 --> 00:52:18.360
Let's go.

00:52:25.600 --> 00:52:28.200
<i>What is there for me to question?</i>

00:52:28.390 --> 00:52:31.440
I'm supposed to be empty...

00:52:31.440 --> 00:52:34.220
Both me, and this sword...

00:52:34.940 --> 00:52:38.280
I am the clansman of the First King Adolf K. Weismann,

00:52:38.280 --> 00:52:40.950
also known as the Silver King.

00:52:40.950 --> 00:52:43.080
I am Kuroh Yatogami.

00:52:43.080 --> 00:52:47.470
This sword will never be used for my own need...

00:52:48.290 --> 00:52:52.630
This sword will open the path and guide me to my king!

00:52:52.630 --> 00:52:57.480
And... I wield it only to protect him!

00:52:59.130 --> 00:53:01.640
Now I like that expression on your face.

00:53:01.640 --> 00:53:07.870
All right then, as a vassal of the Green King, I must accept your challenge.

00:53:08.480 --> 00:53:10.420
Yukari Mishakuji...

00:53:11.730 --> 00:53:12.930
On guard.

00:53:53.860 --> 00:53:55.540
Kurosuke!

00:54:00.030 --> 00:54:04.310
That last strike of yours was quite beautiful.

00:54:05.870 --> 00:54:07.640
Yukari! Yukari!

00:54:09.040 --> 00:54:10.370
Are you satisfied,

00:54:10.370 --> 00:54:11.390
Yukari?

00:54:11.790 --> 00:54:15.380
Please return. You have done enough.

00:54:15.380 --> 00:54:20.210
The one who stands before you is no 
longer a clansman targeted for capture.

00:54:20.210 --> 00:54:23.400
She is the Third King, the Red King.

00:54:23.400 --> 00:54:29.470
But Nagare, I won't be satisfied unless I return with one head, at least.

00:54:29.470 --> 00:54:33.010
She's a newborn and can barely control her power.

00:54:33.730 --> 00:54:35.910
I can handle her easily.

00:54:35.910 --> 00:54:39.900
No, we achieved what we set out to do.

00:54:39.900 --> 00:54:42.070
One must know when enough is enough.

00:54:42.070 --> 00:54:43.400
Nagare?

00:54:43.400 --> 00:54:46.030
Nagare Hisui, the Green King?!

00:54:46.030 --> 00:54:47.930
What?! This bird?!

00:54:47.930 --> 00:54:50.910
Nah, the bird is probably just a medium.

00:54:50.910 --> 00:54:54.170
Those Greens are capable of all sorts of tricks.

00:54:54.170 --> 00:54:57.790
The Red Clan's strategist is very well informed.

00:54:57.790 --> 00:54:58.940
I'm impressed.

00:54:59.250 --> 00:55:04.760
I regret that I cannot greet you in person, but how do you do, new Red King.

00:55:04.760 --> 00:55:08.450
I am Nagare Hisui, the Fifth and Green King.

00:55:09.510 --> 00:55:11.520
Please excuse me for having to leave so soon.

00:55:11.520 --> 00:55:14.200
As a gesture of my apology, allow me to send you a little birthday present.

00:55:14.200 --> 00:55:16.850
It could also be a memorial gift.

00:55:16.850 --> 00:55:21.280
So show us just how strong your luck is by managing not to die here, Kuroh.

00:55:21.280 --> 00:55:22.210
Wait!

00:55:22.210 --> 00:55:23.880
We will meet again.

00:55:31.410 --> 00:55:33.570
Damn it! They ran away!

00:55:34.120 --> 00:55:36.970
Or maybe they let us off.

00:55:37.250 --> 00:55:39.980
Anyway, let's get the hell out of here.

00:55:42.460 --> 00:55:44.130
What's going on?

00:55:44.130 --> 00:55:47.580
Meow! My hair's standing up!

00:55:49.140 --> 00:55:50.470
Up there!

00:55:50.470 --> 00:55:52.240
Wh-What the hell?!

00:55:59.730 --> 00:56:02.430
That's supposed to be his little present?

00:56:04.110 --> 00:56:05.930
The Lightning Bolt Jutsu?!

00:56:07.780 --> 00:56:10.600
Hey, explain this!

00:56:14.000 --> 00:56:16.660
It's a jutsu... whereby he amasses power...

00:56:16.660 --> 00:56:18.680
from lower-ranking clansman to create lightning.

00:56:18.680 --> 00:56:20.940
Y-You're a woman?!

00:56:20.940 --> 00:56:24.340
Even so, the size of it is unnatural...

00:56:24.340 --> 00:56:29.820
Don't tell me he ordered this mission to others besides the infiltration team?

00:56:47.150 --> 00:56:51.280
He's going to blast us all at once? Damn!

00:56:51.280 --> 00:56:54.840
What're you rambling about? Huh?!

00:56:55.120 --> 00:56:58.210
Say, we should get out of here quickly too!

00:56:58.210 --> 00:56:59.720
It's too late!

00:57:06.800 --> 00:57:08.000
Anna!

00:57:16.060 --> 00:57:18.850
This time I'll protect...

00:57:18.850 --> 00:57:20.080
everyone!

00:58:18.950 --> 00:58:21.370
He dissipated the Lightning Bolt Jutsu...

00:58:21.370 --> 00:58:22.770
He isn't called the Blue King for nothing...

00:58:23.290 --> 00:58:25.140
I suppose I owe him my life...

00:58:34.820 --> 00:58:39.920
I'm not so stupid as to fall for the same trick over and over.

00:58:42.440 --> 00:58:43.590
Fushimi...

00:58:46.310 --> 00:58:47.830
Ready for battle...

00:58:59.490 --> 00:59:00.610
Huh?

00:59:06.290 --> 00:59:08.630
In honor of the new Third King...

00:59:08.630 --> 00:59:11.120
Men! Present your swords!

00:59:12.470 --> 00:59:13.520
Hidaka, ready!

00:59:13.520 --> 00:59:14.710
Enomoto, ready!

00:59:14.710 --> 00:59:15.640
Goto, ready!

00:59:15.640 --> 00:59:17.010
Fuse, ready!

00:59:17.010 --> 00:59:18.130
Domyoji, ready!

00:59:18.130 --> 00:59:19.640
Kamo, ready!

00:59:19.640 --> 00:59:20.820
Benzai, ready!

00:59:20.820 --> 00:59:22.350
Akiyama, ready!

00:59:22.350 --> 00:59:24.590
Fushimi, ready.

00:59:26.690 --> 00:59:28.800
Awashima, ready!

01:00:13.030 --> 01:00:15.840
Hey, Seri. Guten morgen.

01:00:21.410 --> 01:00:23.520
Uh... Th-Th-Thank...

01:00:26.000 --> 01:00:28.830
Thank you for saving us.

01:00:28.830 --> 01:00:31.250
I'm sure my assistance would've been unnecessary...

01:00:31.250 --> 01:00:33.690
if you were in your best condition.

01:00:33.920 --> 01:00:40.090
However, it is a fact that Nagare Hisui, the Green King, warrants surveillance.

01:00:40.090 --> 01:00:42.710
He is a disturbing fellow.

01:00:45.930 --> 01:00:47.600
Anna!

01:00:47.600 --> 01:00:49.200
Thank goodness you're okay!

01:00:49.600 --> 01:00:51.960
You guys are way too late!

01:00:54.280 --> 01:00:55.960
Please take care of the rest.

01:00:56.240 --> 01:00:57.890
Understood.

01:00:58.860 --> 01:01:02.340
By mutual agreement of the Third and Fourth Kings,

01:01:02.700 --> 01:01:07.960
Mihashira Tower, the dominion of the Second King and the Dresden Slates are now

01:01:07.960 --> 01:01:09.960
under the supervision of Scepter 4.

01:01:09.960 --> 01:01:15.240
Fourth King, Reisi Munakata, shall be entrusted with full authority.

01:01:31.770 --> 01:01:32.760
Yes...

01:01:33.310 --> 01:01:36.710
Mikoto Suoh was slain with this.

01:01:52.750 --> 01:01:54.570
Now, now, calm down.

01:01:56.340 --> 01:01:57.950
Mr. Fushimi...

01:01:59.670 --> 01:02:02.410
It is what Mikoto wished for.

01:02:03.510 --> 01:02:06.290
I will not hate you for that.

01:02:06.760 --> 01:02:10.370
But... I don't want to thank you for it either.

01:02:11.140 --> 01:02:12.970
As it should be.

01:02:17.750 --> 01:02:19.740
It's been ages!

01:02:19.740 --> 01:02:22.320
It's been ages! 
It's been ages!

01:02:22.320 --> 01:02:23.380
Have mercy!

01:02:27.620 --> 01:02:29.870
Kurosuke, what is that?

01:02:29.870 --> 01:02:33.540
Candy? Is it hot? Or sweet? Does it taste good?

01:02:33.540 --> 01:02:34.990
It's not food.

01:02:35.670 --> 01:02:39.050
It's a parting gift from Anna Kushina.

01:02:39.050 --> 01:02:41.150
What is it? A marble?

01:02:41.150 --> 01:02:45.170
Yes. She said to keep it as a good-luck charm.

01:02:53.520 --> 01:02:55.180
It's Shiro!

01:03:02.670 --> 01:03:04.140
Shiro...

01:03:05.160 --> 01:03:07.850
Where are you now?

01:03:08.490 --> 01:03:12.850
This person is... Shiro?

01:03:12.850 --> 01:03:14.370
Shiro!

01:03:14.370 --> 01:03:17.180
Shiro! Shiro!

01:03:14.740 --> 01:03:18.360
Hey, Shiro!

01:03:17.180 --> 01:03:21.260
Can't you hear us, Shiro?!

01:03:18.360 --> 01:03:21.260
Hey, Shiro, listen!

01:03:21.260 --> 01:03:22.420
Shiro!

01:03:22.420 --> 01:03:25.540
What's the matter, Weismann?

01:03:27.510 --> 01:03:30.540
I was just thinking it'll be dawn soon.

01:03:35.890 --> 01:03:37.720
And I get to have the best view from here.

01:03:38.440 --> 01:03:42.530
<i>Aren't you used to this view?</i>

01:03:42.530 --> 01:03:44.570
Not really.

01:03:44.570 --> 01:03:47.390
No matter how many times I saw the sun set and rise,

01:03:47.870 --> 01:03:50.230
my world has always remained still.

01:03:51.290 --> 01:03:56.400
But now, I can feel it moving again from that light.

01:03:57.120 --> 01:03:58.750
Dawn...

01:03:58.750 --> 01:04:02.200
<i>The start of a new world.</i>

01:04:14.220 --> 01:04:20.210
I'm relieved that my friends seem to be welcoming a new dawn too.

01:04:22.150 --> 01:04:25.150
A king who's in hiding,

01:04:25.150 --> 01:04:29.560
and unable to go to the rescue of those in need is a failure.

01:04:30.990 --> 01:04:34.660
<i>I was the one who gave orders not to let you return</i>

01:04:34.660 --> 01:04:38.720
after salvaging your reconstructed body.

01:04:38.720 --> 01:04:40.850
Don't blame yourself.

01:04:41.670 --> 01:04:44.790
It was to keep me away from the Green King, wasn't it?

01:04:45.300 --> 01:04:48.120
You needn't feel badly either, Lieutenant.

01:04:48.800 --> 01:04:52.510
They know about this ship from hacking the database in Mihashira Tower.

01:04:52.510 --> 01:04:54.620
This is the end of obscurity.

01:04:56.100 --> 01:04:59.620
Everything and everyone has begun moving again.

01:05:00.350 --> 01:05:05.630
<i>I had a feeling this would happen from the moment I saw your corpse</i>

01:05:05.860 --> 01:05:10.640
<i>As the Gold King who represents destiny,</i> I <i>was able to understand.</i>

01:05:11.200 --> 01:05:13.850
<i>Things as they are will change.</i>

01:05:13.850 --> 01:05:14.760
<i>Rather...</i>

01:05:14.760 --> 01:05:17.700
it will end?

01:05:17.700 --> 01:05:24.040
<i>And I will be forcing you to pick up after my mess.</i>

01:05:24.040 --> 01:05:25.770
No, that's not true.

01:05:26.550 --> 01:05:32.050
Lieutenant, you gave shape to the dreams my sister and I once wished for.

01:05:32.050 --> 01:05:37.020
Using the Slates, you saw through so many dreams...

01:05:37.020 --> 01:05:43.400
great ones, little ones, good ones, bad ones, too many to count.

01:05:43.400 --> 01:05:45.750
That's not true either.

01:05:45.750 --> 01:05:46.750
Huh?

01:05:47.070 --> 01:05:50.900
They were the dreams the three of us shared.

01:05:50.900 --> 01:05:53.760
That is why I wanted to fulfill them.

01:05:55.330 --> 01:05:56.860
Weismann...

01:05:57.580 --> 01:06:02.330
The new world is beautiful, isn't it?

01:06:02.330 --> 01:06:03.500
Yes.

01:06:03.500 --> 01:06:08.700
The dream we once saw, had a view like this.

01:06:09.420 --> 01:06:10.520
Yes.

01:06:10.520 --> 01:06:15.210
What a waste... to close my eyes.

01:06:18.930 --> 01:06:20.050
Yes...

01:06:56.970 --> 01:06:58.470
Lieutenant...

01:06:58.470 --> 01:07:02.420
Just as you did, I will move forward until my very last breath...

01:07:14.820 --> 01:07:17.160
I won't run away this time.

01:07:17.160 --> 01:07:19.010
I will face it head on.

01:12:47.650 --> 01:12:49.920
The burden of killing a King...

01:12:51.490 --> 01:12:53.760
I shall accept that challenge.
